.Dd March 12, 2026
.Dt FREE_IRQ 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm free_irq
.Nd unregister an interrupt handler
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In sys/irq.h
.Ft void
.Fn free_irq "unsigned int irq" "void *dev_id"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn free_irq
function removes the handler registered for the supplied IRQ and
client identifier.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr request_irq 9
